  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given word is MATHS</p><p>Arranging the letters alphabetically, we get</p><p>AHMST</p><p>When the word starts with any of the letters A/H/M/S, the number of possibilities<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>96</mn></math></p><p>Now when the word starts with TA, then the number of possibilities<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now when the word starts with THAMS, then the number of possibilities&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Rank&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>96</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>103</mn></math></p><p>Hence, rank of the work THAMS is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>103</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
